{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"SUSE-SU-2026:5416-1","published":"2026-11-23T16:34:45Z","modified":"2026-11-24T17:23:24.798826243Z","related":["CVE-2024-49761","CVE-2025-58767","CVE-2026-132825","CVE-2026-27820","CVE-2026-41316"],"upstream":["CVE-2024-49761","CVE-2025-58767","CVE-2026-132825","CVE-2026-27820","CVE-2026-41316"],"summary":"Security update for ruby2.5","details":"This update for ruby2.5 fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2024-49761: ReDoS vulnerability (bsc#1232440 bsc#1232441).\n- CVE-2025-58767: denial of service when parsing XML containing multiple XML declarations (bsc#1250016).\n- CVE-2026-27820: insufficient checks in `zstream_buffer_ungets` can lead to a buffer overflow (bsc#1259239).\n- CVE-2026-41316: erb: @_init deserialization guard bypass via def_module / def_method / def_class (bsc#1262441).\n- CVE-2026-132825: Heap buffer overflow in case conversion of strings (bsc#1290919).\n- Double free in regular expression compilation (bsc#1290920).\n- Heap buffer overflow in Regexp#to_s (bsc#1290925).\n- Heap buffer overflow in regular expression compilation (bsc#1290924).\n- Integer overflow in case conversion of strings (bsc#1290921).\n- Out-of-bounds read in case-insensitive backreference matching (bsc#1290926).\n- Out-of-bounds read in case-insensitive regular expression matching (bsc#1290923).\n\nChanges for ruby2.5:\n\n- Fix exclusion of test_dl2, drb and rinda tests from testsuite\n- disable the DRb and Rinda tests in %check\n - they require loopback DRb connections and IPv4 multicast routing that\n the network-isolated build worker does not provide; the resulting\n Errno::ECONNREFUSED/ENETUNREACH/ENODEV failures are environmental and\n were misread as regressions in the rexml and erb security updates\n- disable the SSL tests because the fixtures need to be regenerated\n- disable the SSL tests that are timing out due to the old certs\n- disable the tests the SSL tests are fixed\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"ruby2.5","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Enterprise High Performance Computing 15 SP4-ESPOS","purl":"pkg:rpm/suse/ruby2.5&distro=SUSE%20Linux%20Enterprise%20High%20Performance%20Computing%2015%20SP4-ESPOS"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.5.9-150000.4.61.1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"binaries":[{"libruby2_5-2_5":"2.5.9-150000.4.61.1","ruby2.5":"2.5.9-150000.4.61.1","ruby2.5-devel":"2.5.9-150000.4.61.1","ruby2.5-devel-extra":"2.5.9-150000.4.61.1","ruby2.5-stdlib":"2.5.9-150000.4.61.1"}]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://ftp.suse.com/pub/projects/security/osv/SUSE-SU-2026:5416-1.json"}},{"package":{"name":"ruby2.5","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Enterprise High Performance Computing 15 SP4-LTSS","purl":"pkg:rpm/suse/ruby2.5&distro=SUSE%20Linux%20Enterprise%20High%20Performance%20Computing%2015%20SP4-LTSS"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.5.9-150000.4.61.1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"binaries":[{"libruby2_5-2_5":"2.5.9-150000.4.61.1","ruby2.5":"2.5.9-150000.4.61.1","ruby2.5-devel":"2.5.9-150000.4.61.1","ruby2.5-devel-extra":"2.5.9-150000.4.61.1","ruby2.5-stdlib":"2.5.9-150000.4.61.1"}]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://ftp.suse.com/pub/projects/security/osv/SUSE-SU-2026:5416-1.json"}},{"package":{"name":"ruby2.5","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Enterprise High Performance Computing 15 SP5-ESPOS","purl":"pkg:rpm/suse/ruby2.5&distro=SUSE%20Linux%20Enterprise%20High%20Performance%20Computing%2015%20SP5-ESPOS"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.5.9-150000.4.61.1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"binaries":[{"libruby2_5-2_5":"2.5.9-150000.4.61.1","ruby2.5":"2.5.9-150000.4.61.1","ruby2.5-devel":"2.5.9-150000.4.61.1","ruby2.5-devel-extra":"2.5.9-150000.4.61.1","ruby2.5-stdlib":"2.5.9-150000.4.61.1"}]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://ftp.suse.com/pub/projects/security/osv/SUSE-SU-2026:5416-1.json"}},{"package":{"name":"ruby2.5","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Enterprise High Performance Computing 15 SP5-LTSS"